[00:26.28] Bright as the stars,
[00:27.36] Rise and fall
[00:29.48] Do you ever wonder
[00:33.44] Where it all starts?
[00:37.58] Believe it;
[00:40.63] Wear the cloak.
[00:43.75] Swimming above,
[00:48.86] Watching the flood
[00:52.91] Bright as the stars
[01:03.95] Rise and fall
[01:08.05] Do you ever wonder
[01:12.13] Where do we start?
[01:15.18] Believe it;
[01:19.24] The rain will come
[01:23.29] Another night,
[01:27.32] Another day.
[01:38.44] Everywhere we look
[01:41.58] Lights are moving faster,
[01:45.65] And then,
[01:48.63] You see it there,
[01:52.73] Slowly holding on,
[01:56.78] Colours fill your mind,
[02:00.85] And voices,
[02:04.85] Singing our song,
[02:07.87] And voices,
[02:11.92] Singing along
[02:23.91] Here we are,
[02:26.91] Standing tall,
[02:31.04] Waiting and hoping.
[02:35.06] See the lights shut (or last shard?)
[02:40.02] Over me,
[02:42.12] Over the water.
[02:46.13] Another day goes by,
[02:57.41] Love in your eyes
[03:01.57] Stare patiently
[03:05.52] To see the sky.
[03:06.53] Then what?
[03:10.63] (People walking by
[03:13.68] You smile as you walk by)
[03:17.75] 